(1, 'Action AIDS', 'Helo', 'Story', '<p>Hello there.<br><br></p>\r\n<p>Got it. Let\'s refine the <code>spotlight.php</code> file with those improvements.</p>\r\n<p>Here are the changes I\'ve made:</p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\">\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Increased Excerpt Length:</strong> The description preview is now set to <strong>220 characters</strong> instead of 150.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>\"Read More\" Animation:</strong> I\'ve added a subtle \"move right\" animation to the arrow icon (<code>&lt;i class=\"fas fa-arrow-right\"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</code>) when you hover over the \"Read More\" link.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p><strong>Improved Responsiveness:</strong> I\'ve added a <code>@media</code> query to make the page look better on mobile devices:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The \"Partner Spotlight\" title in the breadcrumb is smaller.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The grid columns are adjusted to stack more cleanly on very small screens.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p>The pagination links are made smaller and wrap to the next line if needed.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>Here is the complete, updated <code>spotlight.php</code> file.</p>', 'assets/uploads/6904b1beeefbc2.39489050_WhatsAppImage2025-10-09at14.47.44_e48d985b.jpg', '[\"assets\\/uploads\\/6904b8dfbbb8d6.79337099_Gemini_Generated_Image_f6s7bhf6s7bhf6s71.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/6904b8dfbbcb50.73986571_Gemini_Generated_Image_f6s7bhf6s7bhf6s7.png\"]', 'http://localhost/turningpoint/admin/add-spotlight.php', '2025-10-31 12:55:26'),
(2, 'Action AID', 'Helos', 'Story', '<p>No, <strong>&ldquo;cap&rdquo;</strong> in football is <strong>not a short form or abbreviation of another word</strong>. It literally comes from the tradition of awarding a <strong>physical cap (hat)</strong> to players each time they played for their national team.</p>\r\n<p>Over time, people stopped giving actual hats for every match, but the term <strong>&ldquo;cap&rdquo; stuck</strong> to mean an international appearance.</p>\r\n<p>So when you see &ldquo;He has 50 caps for England,&rdquo; it simply means he has <strong>played 50 times for the England national team</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>If you want, I can also explain why people sometimes confuse it with &ldquo;capture&rdquo; or &ldquo;capital&rdquo; in other sports contexts&mdash;it&rsquo;s a funny historical quirk. Do you want me to?</p>', 'assets/uploads/690a259e252e73.21609328_a-vibrant-infographic-poster-promoting-s_Oo8XUpIVR5GGOXWCENq01w_1RrvYlnxQJWoN4rpxK4j6A.jpeg', '[\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c3b500.27184120_Screenshot_20251008-085131_ScientificCalculator.jpg\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c3d583.71619767_Screenshot_20251008-084753_ScientificCalculator.jpg\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c3e6f6.39625085_FX-991ES-Plus-Scientific-Calculator_f8bf0c08-80ce-4b13-88ee-2152e189418d.0c7a2e782e093446455b749f6ce19c0e.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c413d1.64906169_AdobeExpress-file3.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c427f0.66565614_Gemini_Generated_Image_b5ecmwb5ecmwb5ec.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c43f65.16248794_ResultSlip_21_073282.pdf\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c44e23.60011282_ResultSlip_21_073281.pdf\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c45d58.70920543_Screenshot_20251006-173748_eFootball.jpg\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a23c7c46c10.47303460_accountTransactionHistory.pdf\"]', 'https://www.playbookux.com/sign-up/', '2025-11-04 16:03:19'),
(3, 'Action AIDss', 'Helosd', 'Story', '<p>No, <strong>&ldquo;cap&rdquo;</strong> in football is <strong>not a short form or abbreviation of another word</strong>. It literally comes from the tradition of awarding a <strong>physical cap (hat)</strong> to players each time they played for their national team.</p>\r\n<p>Over time, people stopped giving actual hats for every match, but the term <strong>&ldquo;cap&rdquo; stuck</strong> to mean an international appearance.</p>\r\n<p>So when you see &ldquo;He has 50 caps for England,&rdquo; it simply means he has <strong>played 50 times for the England national team</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>If you want, I can also explain why people sometimes confuse it with &ldquo;capture&rdquo; or &ldquo;capital&rdquo; in other sports contexts&mdash;it&rsquo;s a funny historical quirk. Do you want me to?</p>', 'assets/uploads/690a26d1767b77.58565333_a-vibrant-infographic-poster-promoting-t_FW8_RlZZQpideNxnv7Qxzw_1RrvYlnxQJWoN4rpxK4j6A.jpeg', '[\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d176b716.49760128_Gemini_Generated_Image_8lv3558lv3558lv3.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d176c9a6.68508347_Gemini_Generated_Image_ttkifuttkifuttki.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d176d902.89517657_Gemini_Generated_Image_yhryfnyhryfnyhry.png\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d176eb88.50847304_Screenshot_20251008-085125_ScientificCalculator.jpg\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d1770000.79703656_ResultSlip_21_073282.pdf\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d1771109.65691823_ResultSlip_21_073281.pdf\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d17720a6.89457637_Screenshot_20251006-173748_eFootball.jpg\",\"assets\\/uploads\\/690a26d1773198.03013385_accountTransactionHistory.pdf\"]', 'http://localhost/turningpoint/admin/add-spotlight.php', '2025-11-04 16:16:17');
